00E7                  (            os9.d):01301         E$KwnMod            RMB       1                   Known Module
00E8                  (            os9.d):01302         E$BMCRC             RMB       1                   Bad Module CRC
00E9                  (            os9.d):01303         E$USigP             RMB       1                   Unprocessed Signal Pending
00EA                  (            os9.d):01304         E$NEMod             RMB       1                   Non Existing Module
00EB                  (            os9.d):01305         E$BNam              RMB       1                   Bad Name
00EC                  (            os9.d):01306         E$BMHP              RMB       1                   (bad module header parity)
00ED                  (            os9.d):01307         E$NoRAM             RMB       1                   No (System) RAM Available
00EE                  (            os9.d):01308         E$DNE               RMB       1                   Directory not empty
